{"_id":"68a7360e8ec3d8323af12c35","nodeId":"jgHa_LeCac0pl6dSADizF","roadmapSlug":"blockchain","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.730Z","description":"# Vyper\n\nVyper is a contract-oriented, Pythonic programming language that targets the Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM). It's designed with security as a primary focus, aiming to make it harder to write insecure smart contracts. Vyper achieves this through features like limited mutability, no modifiers, and mandatory bounds checking.","resources":[{"type":"course","title":"Introduction to Python and Vyper","url":"https://updraft.cyfrin.io/courses/intro-python-vyper-smart-contract-development","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a2a3"},{"type":"course","title":"Intermediate Python and Vyper","url":"https://updraft.cyfrin.io/courses/intermediate-python-vyper-smart-contract-development","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a2a4"},{"type":"course","title":"Advanced Python and Vyper Smart Contract Development","url":"https://updraft.cyfrin.io/courses/advanced-python-vyper-smart-contract-development","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a2a5"},{"type":"official","title":"Vyper Programming Language","url":"https://vyper.readthedocs.io/en/stable/","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a2a6"},{"type":"article","title":"Vyper.fun | Learn Vyper by building games","url":"https://learn.vyperlang.org/#/","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a2a7"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:24:45.750Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/blockchain/content/jgHa_LeCac0pl6dSADizF.md"}